      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORARA BOB (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (25.58) at this track behind Ritza Armani in a Mix. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can go on with it. EBONY VALLEY (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 2.5 lengths behind Axel's Run in 20.10 and recording a new PB here. Strong run latest and looks a key chance on that form. MARLENE JENICE (7) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fourth and beaten 5 lengths (20.41) at this track. Expected to give a good account. ALL ON BARNEY (5) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
